  "body": "G.J. Gardner Homes House and Land Package featuring a Custom design.\r\n\r\nThis lovely four bedroom plan features two living areas, a spacious kitchen and scullery as well as two amazing sunny decks for alfresco dining with your family and friends. The spacious landscaped garden even allows room for a future pool. \r\n\r\nThis is a beautifully designed home in a wonderful location, with a peak of the sea.\r\n\r\nYour plan, our plans, or we can design from scratch. For more information visit our website http://www.gjgardner.co.nz\r\nMORE NEW ZEALANDERS TRUST G.J. GARDNER TO BUILD THEIR HOMES THAN ANY OTHER BUILDER.\r\n\r\nIf you’re thinking about building, make Home Prep the first step in your journey. It’s our essential step-by-step guide to the building process. Full of independent advice and handy information to help you have a great building experience. Get your free copy from gjgardner.co.nz today.\r\n\r\n*Price is an indication only and includes land. Some conditions may apply. Image is artist’s impression only.\r\n\r\nCopyright G.J. Gardner Homes",
